{"municipality_code":"14116","pref":"神奈川県","city":"横浜市泉区","headline":"村の境界の痕跡があるかもしれません。","display_comment_enriched":"横浜市泉区には、地域の歴史や暮らしを伝える案内板や石碑があり、それらを手がかりに街歩きを楽しめます。 周辺には史跡や遺跡にまつわる場所が点在し、「伝泉小次郎親衡館跡」などを起点に歩くと、地域の歴史がぐっと見えやすくなります。 現地では史跡説明板が、地域の歴史を読み解く手がかりになるでしょう。 川沿いや水辺では、その土地の暮らしや水との関わりを伝える歴史案内板が見つかるかもしれません。 ゆかりの人物では嵐ヨシユキに注目すると、地域に残る文化や時代背景をさらに深く知るきっかけになります。 「天王森泉公園・天王森泉館（旧清水製糸場本館）」や「泉中央公園」などの名所も、地域の物語を深掘りする絶好の入口です。","radar_groups":[{"id":"town","title":"街の基盤","metrics":[{"id":"dining","label":"飲食店","short_label":"飲食","count":92,"rank":645,"percentile":65.9,"national_average":234.0,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"parks","label":"公園・遊具","short_label":"公園","count":82,"rank":255,"percentile":86.4,"national_average":35.1,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"public","label":"公共施設","short_label":"公共","count":18,"rank":1276,"percentile":30.3,"national_average":39.8,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"culture","label":"文化施設","short_label":"文化","count":10,"rank":822,"percentile":51.8,"national_average":12.5,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"landscape","label":"景観・樹木","short_label":"景観","count":0,"rank":null,"percentile":0.0,"national_average":0.2,"municipality_total":1896}]},{"id":"history","title":"歴史資産","metrics":[{"id":"temples_shrines","label":"寺社仏閣","short_label":"寺社","count":0,"rank":null,"percentile":0.0,"national_average":8.9,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"historic_sites","label":"史跡・遺跡","short_label":"史跡","count":1,"rank":1445,"percentile":12.5,"national_average":7.8,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"roads_posts","label":"街道・宿場","short_label":"街道","count":0,"rank":null,"percentile":0.0,"national_average":1.2,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"villages","label":"近世村","short_label":"近世村","count":5,"rank":1370,"percentile":25.1,"national_average":31.5,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"civil","label":"土木遺産","short_label":"土木","count":0,"rank":null,"percentile":0.0,"national_average":0.3,"municipality_total":1896}]}],"culture_cards":{"notable_people":["嵐ヨシユキ"],"tourism_